# OS patch series for xnu-8796 (iOS 16.5 / Darwin 22.5.0). One patch path per
# line in application order; `#` starts a comment. Relative paths resolve from
# this directory. Prefixes `arch:`, `soc:`, `device:` select their profile
# roots and `component:<ID>/path` selects a component file.
#
# Intentionally empty. Every patch in the resolved order today targets
# xnu-10063.141.1:
#
#   arch:patches/xnu/series              55 patches written against 10063.141.1
#   soc:patches/xnu/series               2 patches from UniXNU-sm8550-common
#   component:XnuPrelink/patches/        xnu-10063.141.1-security-init.patch
#                                        xnu-10063.141.1-sparse-index.patch
#
# XnuPrelink ships no xnu-8796 patch, and the arch and SoC series have to be
# rebased onto the 8796 baseline before they are referenced here. Putting a
# version-10063 path in this file makes `unixnu status` abort with
# "patch missing" and blocks every later step, so the series stays empty until
# the rebase is done. Record the rebase progress in the packaging area of
# porting.toml.
